OL,4,G0232FAssignment
OL,5,     GIn Normandy, in north-west
OL,6,     GFrance, coastal erosion is a
OL,7,     Gserious and growing problem
OL,8,     Gbecause of rising sea levels. But
OL,9,     Gthere is a dispute about what to
OL,10,     Gdo about it.
OL,11,G0300FBBC News
OL,12,G0306FOutlook
OL,13,     GAntony Penrose knew his mother
OL,14,     GLee Miller was a famous
OL,15,     Gphotographer, but she never
OL,16,     Gtalked about her experiences in
OL,17,     GWorld War Two. He didn't find out
OL,18,     Gwhy until after she died.
